      "target": "../sections/sec-000-acknowledgements.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "The World Health Organization (WHO) is grateful for the contributions of many individuals across different organizations. This digital adaptation kit was \ncoordinated by Maria Barreix; Tigest Tamrat and Özge Tunçalp of the WHO Department of Sexual and Reproductive Health and Research (SRH); Garrett \nMehl and Natschja Ratanaprayul of the WHO Department of Digital Health and Innovations (DHI).\nWHO is grateful to the following individuals for their feedback throughout this process (in alphabetical order): Swapna Abhyankar (Regenstrief Institute); \nAyotunde Adegboyega (WHO); Avni Amin (WHO); Josep",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Acknowledges the WHO departments that coordinated the antenatal care digital adaptation kit and the many people who gave feedback. It also names the funders, including the UNDP-UNFPA-UNICEF-WHO-World Bank Special Programme HRP.",
